  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Todays update broke a feature that many advanced world creators were relying on, which was adding multiple enter triggers through debug mode. \n\nPlease add support for this as a proper feature so we can make a single object detect different layers with different results. (I guess this would also apply to enter collider too). \n\nIt's important if you want to us to keep making advanced worlds. thanks.",
